	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/gamepad_setup/vr_view/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The aiming stick turns by snaps of so many\ndegrees, or smoothly."/>
		<string text="Degrees a second the aiming stick turns at, when\nit turns smoothly."/>
		<string text="The view's edges darken while it moves or\nturns by itself, not with the head."/>
		<string text="Cinematics around the head, a blink at each cut,\nor on a screen ahead."/>
		<string text="How much of the view the HUD fills, at any\ndistance: 100% is 37 degrees across."/>
		<string text="How far ahead the HUD seems to float. Nearer\nthan what you look at, it doubles."/>
		<string text="The width of the panel of the menus, loading\nscreens and cutscenes on a screen."/>
		<string text="How far ahead that panel is held, from where\nthe headset faces when it was last recentred."/>
		<string text="The nearest the headset has, if its runtime can\nchange it. Applied at once."/>
